{title: O Could I Speak the Matchless Worth}
{artist: Samuel Medley}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
O [G]could I speak the [C]matchless [G]worth, O [C]could I [G]sound the [D]glories forth
which [G]in my [Em]Savior [D]shine,
I'd [G]soar and touch the [C]heavenly [G]strings, and [C]vie with [G]Gabriel [D]while he sings
in [G]notes al[D]most di[G]vine.
